  <data name="HiW.Step1Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Create your account</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HiW.Step1Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Sign up as a Student to search housing and find roommates, or as an Owner to list properties. Every account is real-person verified.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HiW.Step2Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Complete your profile</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HiW.Step2Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Students add their university, budget, move-in date and lifestyle details (sleep schedule, noise level, cleanliness). Owners add company info and ownership documents. Upload a student ID or ownership proof to earn the verified badge.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HiW.Step3Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Find housing &amp; roommates</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HiW.Step3Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Browse verified listings by city, price and type. The Roommate Matches page ranks other students by budget overlap, gender preference, smoking, sleep schedule, noise, cleanliness and pets.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HiW.Step4Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Apply &amp; get approved</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HiW.Step4Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Apply to a room with a short message. The owner approves or rejects your application. Approved applications become verified stays.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HiW.Step5Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Review honestly</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HiW.Step5Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>After a verified stay ends, you can review the property and the students you lived with. Reviews are moderated by admins to keep the community safe and honest.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HiW.Step6Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Students and owners can file complaints about a user or a property. Our admin team reviews every complaint and follows up.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HiW.GetStarted" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Get started</value>
  </data>
  <data name="HiW.BrowseHousing" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Browse housing</value>
  </data>
  <data name="About.Lead" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Housing Gate is a student housing marketplace that connects university students with verified property owners — and, more importantly, with each other.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="About.Body" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Moving away from your hometown is hard. Finding a place to live that fits your budget is hard. Finding people you actually want to live with is often the hardest part. Housing Gate was built to solve all three at once.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="About.DifferentTitle" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>What makes us different</value>
  </data>
